coming real-time messages to the DOM seamlessly\n16. ✅ 4.5 Wire up the form submission to send a `POST` request to `/api/messages` and clear the input\n\nAll tasks are complete! Let me add a .gitignore for good measure.\n","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\":\"node_modules/\\n.pglite-data/\\ndist/\\n*.log\\n\",\"path\":\"/tmp/runs/smokes/qwen-moe-q4/message-board/execution/runs/201/app/.gitignore\"}"}}]}
